    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Build \"}\\0\\0\\0\\0$${}\": char array ['\\0','\\0','\\0','\\0','$'] contributes four nulls and one '$'. Appending the CharSequence \"${\" contributes a second '$' (and '{'). Appending \"}\" closes the pattern, giving \"$${}\"."
